{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>梁芷珮（Christy）在節目《南美潮什麼 2》中，帶觀眾體驗厄瓜多爾極致奢華的一面！她勇闖位於海拔3,300米安第斯山脈的Spa中心，更罕有地以泳衣上陣，在溫泉池中大擺甫士，盡顯健康美態。她一邊享受一邊大讚「好正」，完全沉醉在壯麗山景與美食之中，畫面相當寫意！</p><p>梁芷珮見證頂級可可豆誕生 揭厄瓜多爾朱古力魅力</p><p>厄瓜多爾因其獨特的地理位置，擁有近火山、近赤道的氣候，加上安第斯山脈高地和亞馬遜森林的滋養，種植出的可可豆品質極佳，成為世界上出產最多頂級可可豆的國家之一。在節目中，Christy親眼見證了可可豆從採摘到變成香濃朱古力的完整過程，深刻感受到這個「朱古力王國」的產業魅力。</p><p>梁芷珮海拔3300米歎溫泉 泳衣look少女心大爆發</p><p>行程的一大亮點，是Christy帶大家體驗坐落於安第斯山脈高處，海拔高達3,300米山谷裡的Spa中心。她換上泳衣，大方展示其「健康美身材」，享受礦物質豐富卻沒有硫磺味的溫泉。面對絕美山景，Christy不禁「少女心發作」，在池邊大擺「嘟嘴微笑」Pose，並興奮表示：「好正」、「好舒服」，完全樂在其中。</p><p>梁芷珮激讚傳統美食Fritada 食朱古力雪糕想買返香港</p><p>除了享受Spa，Christy亦沒有錯過當地的美食。她品嚐了厄瓜多爾的傳統美食「Fritada」以及用頂級可可豆製成的「朱古力雪糕」，味道讓她讚不絕口，更激動地表示：「點解可以咁正」、「味道啱啱好」，甚至流露出想將美味帶回家的念頭：「好想買返香港」。</p><p>網民羨慕行程：睇見都想去歎世界</p><p>Christy這次奢華的旅程引來不少網民羨慕，紛紛表示被「燒到」，希望有機會親身體驗。「3,300米高空浸溫泉，太識歎了吧！」、「Christy身材keep得好好！好健康嘅美！」、「個朱古力雪糕睇落好吸引，搞到我都想食！」、「呢個行程好正，又食又玩，下次去厄瓜多爾要跟住玩！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_558777586a87e3ebf2af9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_11782043286a87e4370ee82.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_7944521466a87e4811d0a8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_19613504976a87e4da9569f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_274020946a87e4f1ac1fc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_17992915486a87e5101e1de.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07a_18774162276a87e66bbd61e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_4789945426a87e68e5597f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_13058810036a87e6cbda5d9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_19439062846a87e6e141235.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_12023860556a87e6fa0ac5c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_13197687116a87e70ec4947.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_6554417106a87e77cbda10.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_6048528766a87e7a9d1c2d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_14686325046a87e7c8c928e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15a_16450926836a87e7f66c274.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_12743556696a87e814b06ac.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_11407090726a87e831a8d10.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_17657170606a87e8649816b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_21261109146a87e8deb4c70.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_18217630526a87e90254832.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_1004597276a87e929a7128.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_6332798676a87e92e417cd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_4970599946a87e9329cf80.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_780258756a87e95512c18.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/24_15146009996a87e9778aeb3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/25_7954103046a87e9dcf3c47.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/26_11190867386a87e9e08dce8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27_3366568466a87e9e3d81b6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/28_19354628946a87ea00db221.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/29_358474356a87ea4250989.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/30_19137511186a87ea4911f83.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/31_15031716336a87ea6eb1624.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/32_13447483976a87ea7737efb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/33_14811270436a87ea7e1f702.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/34_11293217806a87eaa3b3836.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/35_8058433406a87eac6d00e2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/36_8893142866a87eacb1343a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>有到日本旅遊前要了解的實用資料嗎？</p><p>日本是香港人最愛的兩大旅遊地點，去旅行前必看 5大旅遊保險保障新冠肺炎的比較 ，另外為你推介 日本10大好用電話卡 ，亦可參考 日本8大Wifi蛋推介 。當然亦要事先了解 日本地區天氣、電壓、電源插頭、入境簽證要求及大使館電話 。</p><p>日本已開放自由行，有最新的旅遊景點推介嗎？</p><p>想要行程推薦的可以參考以下資訊： 大阪自由行攻略 、 富士山28大景點 、 福岡自由行懶人包 及 東京自駕遊路線 。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T06:20:25.867510+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1072,"images":38,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}